Wk: 作用在${GetBoardType(PRJGLASS)}上的风荷载标准值(kN/m^2)
μz: ${z}m高处风压高度变化系数(按${REGION}类区计算): (GB50009-2001  7.2.1)
      μz=${μh}×(z/10)^${α2}=${μzcal} ${IsLess(μzcal,μz):+由于${μzcal}<${μz},取μz=${μz}}
μf: 脉动系数  :                  (GB50009-2001  7.4.2-8)
     μf=0.5×35^(1.8×(${α}-0.16))×(z/10)^-${α}=${μf}
βgz: 阵风系数  :                 (GB50009-2001  7.5.1-1)
     βgz=${GetKk(REGION)}×(1+2×μf) = ${βgz} 
Wk=${IsNEqual(γ0,1):+γ0×}βgz×μz×μsl×W0             (JGJ102-2003  5.3.2)
  =${IsNEqual(γ0,1):+${γ0}×}${βgz}×${μz}×${μs}×${ω0}
  =${ωk} kN/m^2  ${WkLESS1:+\r\n   Wk<${ωklim}kN/m^2,取Wk=${ωklim}kN/m^2}

W: 风荷载设计值: kN/m^2
γw : 风荷载作用效应的分项系数：${γwf} 
    按《玻璃幕墙工程技术规范》JGJ 102-2003  5.1.6条规定采用
W=γw×Wk=${γwf}×${ωkt}=${ω}kN/m^2  ${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,42):+
Wf\:负风压作用下风荷载设计值\: kN/m^2
Wf=γw×Wkf=${γwf}×(${ωktx})=${ωx}kN/m^2 }

μz=${μh}×(z/10)^${α2}=${μzcal}  ${IsLess(μzcal,μz):+由于${μzcal}<${μz},取μz=${μz}}
μf=0.5×35^(1.8×(${α}-0.16))×(z/10)^-${α}=${μf}
βgz=${GetKk(REGION)}×(1+2×μf) = ${βgz} 
Wk=${IsNEqual(γ0,1):+γ0×}βgz×μz×μsl×W0             (JGJ102-2003  5.3.2)
  =${IsNEqual(γ0,1):+${γ0}×}${βgz}×${μz}×${μs}×${ω0}
  =${ωk}kN/m^2   ${WkLESS1:+\r\n   Wk<${ωklim}kN/m^2,取Wk=${ωklim}kN/m^2}

W=γw×Wk=${γwf}×${ωkt}=${ω}kN/m^2  ${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,42):+
Wf\:负风压作用下风荷载设计值\: kN/m^2
Wf=γw×Wkf=${γwf}×(${ωktx})=${ωx}kN/m^2 }

A=B×H=${GLS_Bw}×${GLS_Hw}=${GLS_AREA}m^2     ${GLS_DRAWID:+
${GLS_DRAWDESC}\:
${XDrawProfileEX(GLS_DRAWID,GLS_DRAWSLD,GLS_DRAWDESC)}}

αmax: 水平地震影响系数最大值:${GetAmax(DegOfEq,ValOfEq)} 
qEAk: 垂直于玻璃平面的分布水平地震作用(kN/m^2)
qEAk=${IsNEqual(γ0,1):+γ0×}βE×αmax×GAK                      (JGJ102-2003  5.3.4)
    =${IsNEqual(γ0,1):+${γ0}×}${βE}×${GetAmax(DegOfEq,ValOfEq)}×${GAK}
    =${qEk}kN/m^2
rE: 地震作用分项系数: ${γEf}
qEA: 垂直于玻璃平面的分布水平地震作用设计值(kN/m^2)
qEA=rE×qEAk
   =${γEf}×${qEk}
   =${qEA}kN/m^2

qEAk=${IsNEqual(γ0,1):+γ0×}βE×αmax×GAK                      (JGJ102-2003  5.3.4)
    =${IsNEqual(γ0,1):+${γ0}×}${βE}×${GetAmax(DegOfEq,ValOfEq)}×${GAK}
    =${qEk}kN/m^2
qEA=rE×qEAk
   =${γEf}×${qEk}
   =${qEA}kN/m^2

选定面板材料为:${GLASSDESC}
校核依据: σ≤ｆg${ISDOUBLEW:*=${fgwo}N/mm^2}                
q: 玻璃所受组合荷载:
a: ${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,1):+玻璃计算跨度}${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,1):+玻璃短边边长}: ${al}m  ${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,1):+\r\n   b\: 玻璃长边边长\: ${bl}m}
${ISDOUBLEW:*t\: 玻璃板块厚度\: ${to}mm}${ISDOUBLEW:+ti\:  ${GLASSSTRUCTNAME}内侧玻璃厚度为\: ${ti}(mm) \r\n}   ${ISDOUBLEW:+to\:  ${GLASSSTRUCTNAME}外侧玻璃厚度为\: ${to}(mm)}
E: 玻璃弹性模量 : ${Ew}N/mm^2
m: 玻璃板面跨中弯曲系数${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,1):+,按边长比a/b查表${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,0):+6.1.2-1}${Mul(IsNEqual(LINKNUM,6),IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2)):+8.1.5-1}得} : ${GetSMr(al,bl,PRJGLASS,LINKNUM)}
η: 折减系数,根据参数θ查表6.1.2-2 
σw: 玻璃所受应力:
采用${IsLPeak:*风荷载与地震荷载}${IsLPeak:+恒载荷+风载荷+雪载荷}组合:
q=${IsLPeak:*W+ψE×qEA}${IsLPeak:+γg×GAk×cosα+0.9×(W+S)}
 =${IsLPeak:*${ω}+${ψE}×${qEA}}${IsLPeak:+${γGf}×${GAK}×cos${ShapeAngle}+0.9×(${ω}+${SNOW})}
 =${qw}kN/m^2   ${ISDOUBLEW:+\r\n   荷载分配计算\r\n   qo=${ISHOLW:+1.1×}q×to^3/(to^3+ti^3)\r\n     =${ISHOLW:+1.1×}${qw}×${to}^3/(${to}^3+${ti}^3)\r\n     =${qwo}\r\n   qi=q×ti^3/(to^3+ti^3)\r\n    =${qw}×${ti}^3/(${to}^3+${ti}^3)\r\n    =${qwi}}      
 参数θ计算:
${ISDOUBLEW:*θ}${ISDOUBLEW:+θo}=q${ISDOUBLEW:+o}×${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+a}${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+b}^4×10^9/E/t${ISDOUBLEW:+o}^4      ${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,0):+(JGJ102-2003  6.1.2-3)}${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+(JGJ102-2003  8.1.5-4)}
 =${qwo}×${awl}^4×10^9/${Ew}/${to}^4 
 =${θwo}
 查表6.1.2-2 得η${ISDOUBLEW:+o} = ${GetNg(θwo)} ${ISDOUBLEW:+\r\n   θi=qi×${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+a}${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+b}^4×10^9/E/ti^4\r\n     =${qwi}×${awl}^4×10^9/${Ew}/${ti}^4 \r\n     =${θwi} \r\n    查表6.1.2-2 得ηi = ${GetNg(θwi)} }
玻璃最大应力计算:   
σw${ISDOUBLEW:+o}=6×m×${Mul(IsEqual(LINKNUM,6),IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2)):*η${ISDOUBLEW:+o}×}q${ISDOUBLEW:+o}×${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+a}${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+b}^2×1000/t${ISDOUBLEW:+o}^2              ${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,0):+(JGJ102-2003  6.1.2-1)}${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+(JGJ102-2003  8.1.5-1)}
   =6×${GetSMr(al,bl,PRJGLASS,LINKNUM)}×${Mul(IsEqual(LINKNUM,6),IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2)):*${GetNg(θwo)}×}${qwo}×${awl}^2×1000/${to}^2
   =${σwo}N/mm^2   ${ISDOUBLEW:+\r\n   σwi=6×m×${Mul(IsEqual(LINKNUM,6),IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2)):*ηi×}qi×${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+a}${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+b}^2×1000/ti^2            \r\n      =6×${GetSMr(al,bl,PRJGLASS,LINKNUM)}×${Mul(IsEqual(LINKNUM,6),IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2)):*${GetNg(θwi)}×}${qwi}×${awl}^2×1000/${ti}^2\r\n      =${σwi}N/mm^2}
${σwo}N/mm^2${GetLess(FWOLESS)}ｆg=${fgwo}N/mm^2 ${ISDOUBLEW:+\r\n    ${σwi}N/mm^2${GetLess(FWILESS)}ｆg=${fgwi}N/mm^2}
玻璃的强度${FWLESS:*不}满足

选定面板材料为:${GLASSDESC}
校核依据: σ≤ｆg${ISDOUBLEW:*=${fgwo}N/mm^2}                
a: ${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,1):+玻璃计算跨度}${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,1):+玻璃短边边长}: ${al}m  ${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,1):+\r\n   b\: 玻璃长边边长\: ${bl}m}
${ISDOUBLEW:*t\: 玻璃板块厚度\: ${to}mm}${ISDOUBLEW:+ti\:  ${GLASSSTRUCTNAME}内侧玻璃厚度为\: ${ti}(mm) \r\n}   ${ISDOUBLEW:+to\:  ${GLASSSTRUCTNAME}外侧玻璃厚度为\: ${to}(mm)}
m: 玻璃板面跨中弯曲系数${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,1):+,按边长比a/b查表${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,0):+6.1.2-1}${Mul(IsNEqual(LINKNUM,6),IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2)):+8.1.5-1}得} : ${GetSMr(al,bl,PRJGLASS,LINKNUM)}
η: 折减系数,根据参数θ查表6.1.2-2 
σw: 玻璃所受应力:
采用${IsLPeak:*风荷载与地震荷载}${IsLPeak:+恒载荷+风载荷+雪载荷}组合:
q=${IsLPeak:*W+ψE×qEA}${IsLPeak:+γg×GAk×cosα+0.9×(W+S)}
 =${IsLPeak:*${ω}+${ψE}×${qEA}}${IsLPeak:+${γGf}×${GAK}×cos${ShapeAngle}+0.9×(${ω}+${SNOW})}
 =${qw}kN/m^2   ${ISDOUBLEW:+\r\n   荷载分配计算\r\n   qo=${ISHOLW:+1.1×}q×to^3/(to^3+ti^3)\r\n     =${ISHOLW:+1.1×}${qw}×${to}^3/(${to}^3+${ti}^3)\r\n     =${qwo}\r\n   qi=q×ti^3/(to^3+ti^3)\r\n    =${qw}×${ti}^3/(${to}^3+${ti}^3)\r\n    =${qwi}}      
 参数θ计算:
${ISDOUBLEW:*θ}${ISDOUBLEW:+θo}=q${ISDOUBLEW:+o}×${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+a}${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+b}^4×10^9/E/t${ISDOUBLEW:+o}^4      ${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,0):+(JGJ102-2003  6.1.2-3)}${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+(JGJ102-2003  8.1.5-4)}
 =${qwo}×${awl}^4×10^9/${Ew}/${to}^4 
 =${θwo}
 查表6.1.2-2 得η${ISDOUBLEW:+o} = ${GetNg(θwo)} ${ISDOUBLEW:+\r\n   θi=qi×${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+a}${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+b}^4×10^9/E/ti^4\r\n     =${qwi}×${awl}^4×10^9/${Ew}/${ti}^4 \r\n     =${θwi} \r\n    查表6.1.2-2 得ηi = ${GetNg(θwi)} }
玻璃最大应力计算:   
σw${ISDOUBLEW:+o}=6×m×${Mul(IsEqual(LINKNUM,6),IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2)):*η${ISDOUBLEW:+o}×}q${ISDOUBLEW:+o}×${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+a}${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+b}^2×1000/t${ISDOUBLEW:+o}^2              ${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,0):+(JGJ102-2003  6.1.2-1)}${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+(JGJ102-2003  8.1.5-1)}
   =6×${GetSMr(al,bl,PRJGLASS,LINKNUM)}×${Mul(IsEqual(LINKNUM,6),IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2)):*${GetNg(θwo)}×}${qwo}×${awl}^2×1000/${to}^2
   =${σwo}N/mm^2   ${ISDOUBLEW:+\r\n   σwi=6×m×${Mul(IsEqual(LINKNUM,6),IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2)):*ηi×}qi×${IsNEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+a}${IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2):+b}^2×1000/ti^2            \r\n      =6×${GetSMr(al,bl,PRJGLASS,LINKNUM)}×${Mul(IsEqual(LINKNUM,6),IsEqual(PRJGLASS,2)):*${GetNg(θwi)}×}${qwi}×${awl}^2×1000/${ti}^2\r\n      =${σwi}N/mm^2}
${σwo}N/mm^2${GetLess(FWOLESS)}ｆg=${fgwo}N/mm^2 ${ISDOUBLEW:+\r\n    ${σwi}N/mm^2${GetLess(FWILESS)}ｆg=${fgwi}N/mm^2}
玻璃的强度${FWLESS:*不}满足

${AMJ_DRAWID:+${AMJ_DRAWDESC}\:
${XDrawProfileEX(AMJ_DRAWID,AMJ_DRAWSLD,AMJ_DRAWDESC)}
}当前埋件采用${GetBoltLinkTypeDesc(AMJ_LINKTYPE)}。按照如下规则建立埋件坐标系：多排锚筋的中心点为坐标原点，垂直于埋板方向向外为X轴，较大剪力方向向上为Y轴，通过右手法则确定Z轴。
结构传递过来的各项力的作用点(螺孔中心)坐标为: e1=${AMJ_Ex}mm,e2=${AMJ_Ey}mm,e3=${AMJ_Ez}mm,该数据也就是作用偏心距离。
Vy: 竖向剪力设计值，为${AMJ_LcMatrixForce[1]}N
Vz: 水平方向剪力设计值，为${AMJ_LcMatrixForce[2]}N
N: 垂直于埋板的拉压力设计值(拉为正，压为负)，为${AMJ_LcMatrixForce[0]}N
Mxy:主结构传递过来的弯矩${AMJ_LcMatrixForce[5]}N.mm
Mzx:主结构传递过来的水平弯矩${AMJ_LcMatrixForce[4]}N.mm 
Myz:主结构传递过来的扭矩${AMJ_LcMatrixForce[3]}N.mm
Zy: 最上层钢筋与最下层锚筋中心线距离: ${AMJ_Zmj}mm 
Zz: 最左排钢筋与最右排锚筋中心线距离: ${AMJ_ZmjOfH}mm 
Y方向锚筋层数为${AMJ_GJLAYERNUM}，Z方向锚筋层数为${Div(AMJ_GJTOTALNUM,AMJ_GJLAYERNUM)}
考虑作用偏心的实际弯矩为:
Mz: 弯矩设计值(N·mm)
Mz= Mxy + N×e2 + Vy×e1
 = ${GetDataTxtWithSymbol(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[5])} + ${GetDataTxtWithSymbol(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[0])}×${AMJ_Ey} + ${GetDataTxtWithSymbol(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[1])}×${AMJ_Ex}
 = ${AMJ_ForceMxycal}N·mm   ${IsLess(AMJ_ForceMxycal,0):+取绝对值 为 ${AMJ_ForceMxy}N·mm}
My: 水平弯矩设计值(N·mm)
My= Mzx + N×e3 + Vz×e1
 = ${GetDataTxtWithSymbol(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[4])} + ${GetDataTxtWithSymbol(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[0])}×${AMJ_Ez} + ${GetDataTxtWithSymbol(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[2])}×${AMJ_Ex}
 = ${AMJ_ForceMzxcal}N·mm   ${IsLess(AMJ_ForceMzxcal,0):+取绝对值 为 ${AMJ_ForceMzx}N·mm}
Mx: 扭矩设计值(N·mm)
Mx= Myz + Vy×e3 + Vz×e2
 = ${GetDataTxtWithSymbol(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[3])} + ${GetDataTxtWithSymbol(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[1])}×${AMJ_Ez} + ${GetDataTxtWithSymbol(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[2])}×${AMJ_Ey}
 = ${AMJ_ForceMyzcal}N·mm   ${IsLess(AMJ_ForceMyzcal,0):+取绝对值 为 ${AMJ_ForceMyz}N·mm}  ${IsLarge(AMJ_ForceMyz,0):+
计算扭矩对锚筋产生的附加剪力见下表 
${AMJ_VTable}
由于附加扭矩造成每根锚筋的剪力大小并不完全一样，为安全起见，选择最大的剪力作为后面锚筋面积的计算依据。
单个锚筋最大剪力为    Fymax = ${AMJ_VofMyz[5]}N    Fzmax = ${AMJ_VofMyz[6]}N 
锚筋面积校核采用的剪力为 Fy = Fymax×${AMJ_GJTOTALNUM} =${AMJ_ForceY}N    Fz = Fzmax×${AMJ_GJTOTALNUM} =${AMJ_ForceZ}N  }

${AMJ_DRAWID:+${AMJ_DRAWDESC}\:
${XDrawProfileEX(AMJ_DRAWID,AMJ_DRAWSLD,AMJ_DRAWDESC)}
}当前埋件采用${GetBoltLinkTypeDesc(AMJ_LINKTYPE)}。按照如下规则建立埋件坐标系：多排锚筋的中心点为坐标原点，垂直于埋板方向向外为X轴，较大剪力方向向上为Y轴，通过右手法则确定Z轴。
结构传递过来的各项力的作用点(螺孔中心)坐标为: e1=${AMJ_Ex}mm,e2=${AMJ_Ey}mm,e3=${AMJ_Ez}mm,该数据也就是作用偏心距离。
Vy: 竖向剪力设计值，为${AMJ_LcMatrixForce[1]}N
Vz: 水平方向剪力设计值，为${AMJ_LcMatrixForce[2]}N
N: 垂直于埋板的拉压力设计值(拉为正，压为负)，为${AMJ_LcMatrixForce[0]}N
Mxy:主结构传递过来的弯矩${AMJ_LcMatrixForce[5]}N.mm
Mzx:主结构传递过来的水平弯矩${AMJ_LcMatrixForce[4]}N.mm 
Myz:主结构传递过来的扭矩${AMJ_LcMatrixForce[3]}N.mm
Zy: 最上层钢筋与最下层锚筋中心线距离: ${AMJ_Zmj}mm 
Zz: 最左排钢筋与最右排锚筋中心线距离: ${AMJ_ZmjOfH}mm 
Y方向锚筋层数为${AMJ_GJLAYERNUM}，Z方向锚筋层数为${Div(AMJ_GJTOTALNUM,AMJ_GJLAYERNUM)}
考虑作用偏心的实际弯矩为:
Mz: 弯矩设计值(N·mm)
Mz= Mxy + N×e2 + Vy×e1
 = ${GetTxt(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[5])} + ${GetTxt(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[0])}×${AMJ_Ey} + ${GetTxt(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[1])}×${AMJ_Ex}
 = ${AMJ_ForceMxycal}N·mm   ${IsLess(AMJ_ForceMxycal,0):+取绝对值 为 ${AMJ_ForceMxy}N·mm}
My: 水平弯矩设计值(N·mm)
My= Mzx + N×e3 + Vz×e1
 = ${GetTxt(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[4])} + ${GetTxt(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[0])}×${AMJ_Ez} + ${GetTxt(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[2])}×${AMJ_Ex}
 = ${AMJ_ForceMzxcal}N·mm   ${IsLess(AMJ_ForceMzxcal,0):+取绝对值 为 ${AMJ_ForceMzx}N·mm}
Mx: 扭矩设计值(N·mm)
Mx= Myz + Vy×e3 + Vz×e2
 = ${GetTxt(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[3])} + ${GetTxt(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[1])}×${AMJ_Ez} + ${GetTxt(AMJ_LcMatrixForce[2])}×${AMJ_Ey}
 = ${AMJ_ForceMyzcal}N·mm   ${IsLess(AMJ_ForceMyzcal,0):+取绝对值 为 ${AMJ_ForceMyz}N·mm}  ${IsLarge(AMJ_ForceMyz,0):+
计算扭矩对锚筋产生的附加剪力见下表 
${AMJ_VTable}
由于附加扭矩造成每根锚筋的剪力大小并不完全一样，为安全起见，选择最大的剪力作为后面锚筋面积的计算依据。
单个锚筋最大剪力为    Fymax = ${AMJ_VofMyz[5]}N    Fzmax = ${AMJ_VofMyz[6]}N 
锚筋面积校核采用的剪力为 Fy = Fymax×${AMJ_GJTOTALNUM} =${AMJ_ForceY}N    Fz = Fzmax×${AMJ_GJTOTALNUM} =${AMJ_ForceZ}N  }

Nsnum: 锚筋根数: ${AMJ_GJTOTALNUM}根
两个方向的锚筋层数: ${AMJ_GJLAYERNUM}，${AMJ_arMat[3]}
αr: 两个方向的锚筋层数影响系数分别为: ${AMJ_arMat[0]}，${AMJ_arMat[1]}
混凝土级别：${AMJ_CONCRETELEVEL}
混凝土强度设计值:fc=${GetFa(AMJ_CONCRETELEVEL,0)}N/mm^2
按现行国家标准≤混凝土结构设计规范≥ GB 50010采用。
锚筋级别: ${AMJ_STEELMJLEVEL}
锚筋强度设计值:fy=${GetFa(AMJ_STEELMJLEVEL,0)}N/mm^2 ${AMJ_FYMJSTEEL:+
由于fy>300N/mm^2,按照规范JGJ102-2003 c.0.1 取fy=300N/mm^2}
d: 钢筋直径: Φ${AMJ_Dmj}mm
αv: 钢筋受剪承载力系数:
αv=(4-0.08×d)×(fc/fy)^0.5              (JGJ102-2003  C.0.1-5)
  =(4-0.08×${AMJ_Dmj})×(${GetFa(AMJ_CONCRETELEVEL,0)}/${AMJ_Fymjsteel})^0.5
  =${AMJ_Vcal}
αv 取 ${AMJ_V}
t: 锚板厚度: ${AMJ_Tmj}mm
αb: 锚板弯曲变形折减系数:
αb=0.6+0.25×t/d                         (JGJ102-2003  C.0.1-6)
  =0.6+0.25×${AMJ_Tmj}/${AMJ_Dmj}
  =${AMJ_B}
Z: 两个方向最外层钢筋中心线距离: ${AMJ_Zmj}mm，${AMJ_ZmjOfH}mm
As: 锚筋实际总截面积:
