 ∑y^2=${BOLTANR_center[2]}
 y坐标最高的锚栓为${BOLTANR_center[5]}号锚栓，该点的y坐标为${BOLTANR_center[4]}，该点到形心点的y向距离为
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('y','','1')}= ${BOLTANR_center[4]}-${BOLTANR_center[1]} = ${Sub(BOLTANR_center[4],BOLTANR_center[1])}mm 
 y坐标最低的锚栓为${BOLTANR_center[7]}号锚栓，该点的y坐标为${BOLTANR_center[6]}，该点到形心点的y向距离为
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('y','','2')}= ${BOLTANR_center[6]}-${BOLTANR_center[1]} = ${Sub(BOLTANR_center[6],BOLTANR_center[1])}mm  
 所以锚栓群的最大和最小受力为：
 ${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('N','','min')}= \\f(N×r,n) + \\f(M×${GetSSubFormat('y','','2')},∑y^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
     ${GetEQFormat(0)}=\\f(${BOLTANR_ForceX}×${BOLTANR_nratio},${GetBoltNumber(BOLTANR_Layout)}) + \\f(${BOLTANR_ForceMxy}×(${Sub(BOLTANR_center[6],BOLTANR_center[1])}),${BOLTANR_center[2]})${GetEQFormat(1)}
     =${BOLTANR_nminf}N
 ${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('N','','max')}=\\f(N×r,n) + \\f(M×${GetSSubFormat('y','','1')},∑y^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
     ${GetEQFormat(0)}=\\f(${BOLTANR_ForceX}×${BOLTANR_nratio},${GetBoltNumber(BOLTANR_Layout)}) + \\f(${BOLTANR_ForceMxy}×${Sub(BOLTANR_center[4],BOLTANR_center[1])},${BOLTANR_center[2]})${GetEQFormat(1)}
     =${BOLTANR_nmaxf}N    ${IsLess(BOLTANR_nminf,0):+
 由于${GetEQSSubFormat('N','','min')}<0，说明连接下部受压，在弯矩作用下构件绕最底排锚栓转动，此时，分析计算得到各锚栓到底排锚栓的Y向距离平方之和为
 ∑${GetEQSSubFormat('y','','d')}^2=${BOLTANR_center[3]}
 最高锚栓点到底排锚栓点的y向距离为
 ${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('y','','d')}= ${BOLTANR_center[4]}-${BOLTANR_center[6]} = ${Sub(BOLTANR_center[4],BOLTANR_center[6])}mm${GetEQFormat(1)}  
 e\:作用点到锚栓群转动中心的距离为${Sub(BOLTANR_center[1],BOLTANR_center[6])}mm
 锚栓最大受力为  
 ${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('N','','max')}= \\f((M+N×r×e)×${GetSSubFormat('y','','d')},∑${GetSSubFormat('y','','d')}^2)${GetEQFormat(1)} 
     ${GetEQFormat(0)}= \\f((${BOLTANR_ForceMxy}+${BOLTANR_ForceX}×${BOLTANR_nratio}×${Sub(BOLTANR_center[1],BOLTANR_center[6])})×${Sub(BOLTANR_center[4],BOLTANR_center[6])},${BOLTANR_center[3]})${GetEQFormat(1)}
     =${BOLTANR_nmaxb}N   } }${BOLTANR_ForceMzx:+
 2、在拉力和弯矩Mzx共同作用下,锚栓群有两种可能的受力形式。
 首先假定锚栓群绕自身的中心进行转动，经过分析得到锚栓群形心坐标为[${BOLTANR_centerz[0]},${BOLTANR_centerz[1]}]，各锚栓到锚栓形心点的X向距离平方之和为
 ∑x^2=${BOLTANR_centerz[2]}
 x坐标最高的锚栓为${BOLTANR_centerz[5]}号锚栓，该点的x坐标为${BOLTANR_centerz[4]}，该点到形心点的x向距离为
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('x','','1')}= ${BOLTANR_centerz[4]}-${BOLTANR_centerz[1]} = ${Sub(BOLTANR_centerz[4],BOLTANR_centerz[1])}mm 
 x坐标最低的锚栓为${BOLTANR_centerz[7]}号锚栓，该点的x坐标为${BOLTANR_centerz[6]}，该点到形心点的x向距离为
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('x','','2')}= ${BOLTANR_centerz[6]}-${BOLTANR_centerz[1]} = ${Sub(BOLTANR_centerz[6],BOLTANR_centerz[1])}mm  
 所以锚栓群的最大和最小受力为：
 ${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('N','','min')}= \\f(N×r,n) + \\f(M×${GetSSubFormat('x','','2')},∑x^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
     ${GetEQFormat(0)}= \\f(${BOLTANR_ForceX}×${BOLTANR_nratio},${GetBoltNumber(BOLTANR_Layout)}) + \\f(${BOLTANR_ForceMzx}×(${Sub(BOLTANR_centerz[6],BOLTANR_centerz[1])}),${BOLTANR_centerz[2]})${GetEQFormat(1)}
     =${BOLTANR_nminfz}N
 ${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('N','','max')}= \\f(N×r,n) + \\f(M×${GetSSubFormat('x','','1')},∑x^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
     ${GetEQFormat(0)}= \\f(${BOLTANR_ForceX}×${BOLTANR_nratio},${GetBoltNumber(BOLTANR_Layout)}) + \\f(${BOLTANR_ForceMzx}×${Sub(BOLTANR_centerz[4],BOLTANR_centerz[1])},${BOLTANR_centerz[2]})${GetEQFormat(1)}
     =${BOLTANR_nmaxfz}N    ${IsLess(BOLTANR_nminfz,0):+
 由于${GetEQSSubFormat('N','','min')}<0，说明连接左部受压，在弯矩作用下构件绕最左排锚栓转动，此时，分析计算得到各锚栓到左排锚栓的X向距离平方之和为
 ∑${GetEQSSubFormat('x','','d')}^2=${BOLTANR_centerz[3]}
 最右锚栓点到最左锚栓点的x向距离为
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('x','','d')}= ${BOLTANR_centerz[4]}-${BOLTANR_centerz[6]} = ${Sub(BOLTANR_centerz[4],BOLTANR_centerz[6])}mm  
 e\:作用点到锚栓群转动中心的距离为${Sub(BOLTANR_centerz[1],BOLTANR_centerz[6])}mm
 锚栓最大受力为   
 ${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('N','','max')}= \\f((M+N×r×e)×${GetSSubFormat('x','','d')},∑${GetSSubFormat('x','','d')}^2)${GetEQFormat(1)} 
     ${GetEQFormat(0)}= \\f((${BOLTANR_ForceMzx}+${BOLTANR_ForceX}×${BOLTANR_nratio}×${Sub(BOLTANR_centerz[1],BOLTANR_centerz[6])})×${Sub(BOLTANR_centerz[4],BOLTANR_centerz[6])},${BOLTANR_centerz[3]})${GetEQFormat(1)}
     =${BOLTANR_nmaxbz}N   }}  ${IsEqual(BOLTANR_nratio,0.5):+
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('N','','t')}\: 单个锚栓承受的最大拉力为${BOLTANR_t}N}
 单个锚栓承受的剪力为
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('N','','v')}=${BOLTANR_v}N
 强度验算
  ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r(\\b(\\f(${GetSSubFormat('N','','v')},${GetSSubFormat('N','','bv')}))^2 + \\b(\\f(${GetSSubFormat('N','','t')},${GetSSubFormat('N','','bt')}))^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}   (GB50017-2017 11.4.1-8)
  ${GetEQFormat(0)}=\\r(\\b(\\f(${BOLTANR_v},${BOLTANR_nbv}))^2 + \\b(\\f(${BOLTANR_t},${BOLTANR_nbt}))^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
  =${BOLTANR_TStrength}${GetLess(BOLTANR_Strength)}1   
 考虑安全系数${BOLTANR_SafetyFactor}，锚栓实验拉拔力需要达到${BOLTANR_NCT}kN
 所以锚栓强度${GetOKStr(BOLTANR_Strength)}满足要求

A:锚板面积
${GetEQFormat(0)}A =${GetSSubFormat('B','','w')}×${GetSSubFormat('B','','h')}${GetEQFormat(1)}
