  =${LOADSSLOP_ωkp[0]} kN/m^2${IsNEqual(LOADSSLOP_ωkp[0],LOADSSLOP_WKP[0]):+ < ${LOADSSLOP_WKP[0]}kN/m^2,取${LOADSSLOP_WKP[0]}kN/m^2}
${GetEQSSubFormat('W','','k2')}: 背风风荷载标准值
${GetEQSSubFormat('W','','k2')}=${GetEQSSubFormat('β','','gz')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('K','','1')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('K','','2')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('μ','','s2')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('μ','','z')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('W','','0')}   
  =${LOADSSLOP_βgz}×${LOADSSLOP_TERRAINFACTOR}×${LOADSSLOP_DIRECTCOEF}×(${LOADSSLOP_SHAPECOEFT2})×${LOADSSLOP_μz}×${ω0}
  =${LOADSSLOP_ωkp[1]} kN/m^2${IsNEqual(LOADSSLOP_ωkp[1],LOADSSLOP_WKP[1]):+ > ${LOADSSLOP_WKP[1]}kN/m^2,取${LOADSSLOP_WKP[1]}kN/m^2}

${GetEQSSubFormat('S','','k')}: 雪荷载标准值(kN/m^2)
${GetEQSSubFormat('S','','0')}: 基本雪压,${CITYNAME}${SNOWYEARS}年一遇最大积雪的自重: ${GLOB_S0}kN/m^2
    根据现行<<建筑结构荷载规范>>GB50009-2012取值
${GetEQSSubFormat('μ','','r')}: 屋面积雪分布系数,${IsEqual(LOADSSLOP_SNOWCOEF,0):+根据GB50009-2012屋面积雪分布系数表7.2.1,按照坡面角度${LOADSSLOP_ANGLE}度,}取${LOADSSLOP_SnowCoef}
根据<<建筑结构荷载规范>>GB50009-2012公式7.1.1屋面雪载荷按下式计算
 ${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('S','','k')}=${GetSSubFormat('μ','','r')}×${GetSSubFormat('S','','0')}${GetEQFormat(1)}
   ${GetEQFormat(0)}=${LOADSSLOP_SnowCoef}×${GLOB_S0}${GetEQFormat(1)}
   =${LOADSSLOP_Sk}kN/m^2

S:  雪载荷设计值(kN/m^2)
γs: 雪载荷分项系数为  ${γsf}
S=γs×Sk
 =${γsf}×${LOADSSLOP_Sk}
 =${LOADSSLOP_SNOW}kN/m^2

GK:重力荷载代表值取结构自重值(kN/m^2)
GK=GAK
  =${LOADSSLOP_GAKV}kN/m^2
αvmaxii: 竖向地震影响系数最大值:${EqAVMax2}
Fa: 场地地震动峰值加速度调正系数，取${EqAMaxFa}
αvmax = Fa×αvmaxii = ${EqAVMax}
qEVk: 分布竖向地震作用标准值(kN/m^2)
qEVk=βE×αvmax×GK                      (JGJ102-2003  5.3.4)
    =${βE}×${EqAVMax}×${LOADSSLOP_GAKV}
    =${LOADSSLOP_VEAK}kN/m^2
rE: 地震作用分项系数: ${γEf}
qEAV: 分布竖向地震作用设计值(kN/m^2)
qEAV=rE×qEVk
   =${γEf}×${LOADSSLOP_VEAK}
   =${LOADSSLOP_qEAV}kN/m^2

