${GetEQFormat(0)}P = 1000×${GetSSubFormat('μ','','z')}×${GetSSubFormat('μ','','c')}×${GetSSubFormat('ω','','0')}${GetEQFormat(1)}                       GB/T 21086--2007 5.1.2.1
z : 计算高度${WSEAL_ELEVATION}m
${GetEQSSubFormat('μ','','z')}: ${WSEAL_ELEVATION}m高处风压高度变化系数(按${REGION}类区计算):  ${GLOB_LC_GD:*(GB50009-2012  条文说明8.2.1)}
    ${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('μ','','z')}=${μh}×(\\f(z,10))^${α2}=${WSEAL_μzcal}${GetEQFormat(1)} ${IsLess(WSEAL_μzcal,WSEAL_μz):+由于${WSEAL_μzcal}<${WSEAL_μz},取${GetEQSSubFormat('μ','','z')}=${WSEAL_μz}}
${GetEQSSubFormat('μ','','c')}: 风力系数，可取${WSEAL_RATIOC}
${GetEQSSubFormat('ω','','0')}: ${CITYNAME}地区基本风压，取${ω0}kN/m^2，${CITYNAME}地区所属气候区域为${GLOB_CLIMATE}类气候  
所以有：
${GetEQFormat(0)}P = 1000×${GetSSubFormat('μ','','z')}×${GetSSubFormat('μ','','c')}×${GetSSubFormat('ω','','0')}  ${GetEQFormat(1)}
  = 1000×${WSEAL_μz}×${WSEAL_RATIOC}×${ω0}
  = ${WSEAL_CAL}Pa  ${IsLess(GetWaterSealRatio(GLOB_CLIMATE),1.0):+  
由于该地区所属气候区域为${GLOB_CLIMATE}类气候，根据GB/T 21086--2007 5.1.2.1(b)规定，实际水密性能按照上式的75%进行设计，即
P×0.75 = ${WSEAL_VALUE}Pa}

玻璃肋结构:${GetRibGlassDesc(GRIB_STRUCT,GRIB_FilmType)}
b: 玻璃肋的等效厚度: ${GRIB_b}mm
d: 玻璃肋的截面高度 ${GRIB_H}mm
当前玻璃肋稳定性按照${GRIB_ConstType:+无}侧边约束计算
玻璃肋处于室${GRIB_Indoors:*内}${GRIB_Indoors:+外}
玻璃肋所承受的弯矩为:
正风组合荷载作用下
${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('M','','p')}=1/8×q×B×${GetSSubFormat('H','','cal')}^2${GetEQFormat(1)}
 ${GetEQFormat(0)}=1/8×${GRIB_COMPP}×${GRIB_Bw}×${GRIB_Hw}^2${GetEQFormat(1)}
 =${GRIB_Mp}kN.m
负风组合荷载作用下
${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('M','','n')}=1/8×q×B×${GetSSubFormat('H','','cal')}^2${GetEQFormat(1)}
 ${GetEQFormat(0)}=1/8×(${GRIB_COMPN})×${GRIB_Bw}×${GRIB_Hw}^2${GetEQFormat(1)}
 =${GRIB_Mn}kN.m   
屈曲临界临界弯矩计算公式 ${GRIB_ConstType:*
${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('M','','cr')} = \\f(\\b(\\f(π,${GetSSubFormat('L','','ay')}))^2×E${GetSSubFormat('I','','y')}×(\\f(d^2,12) + ${GetSSubFormat('y','','0')}^2) + GJ,2${GetSSubFormat('y','','0')}+${GetSSubFormat('y','','h')})${GetEQFormat(1)}  }${GRIB_ConstType:+
${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('M','','cr')} = \\f(${GetSSubFormat('g','','2')},${GetSSubFormat('L','','ay')})×(E×${GetSSubFormat('I','','y')}×GJ)^0.5×\\b(1-${GetSSubFormat('g','','3')}×\\f(${GetSSubFormat('y','','h')},${GetSSubFormat('L','','ay')})×\\b(\\f(E×${GetSSubFormat('I','','y')},GJ))^0.5)${GetEQFormat(1)}   }
上式中，Iy为侧向惯性矩
${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetSSubFormat('I','','y')}= \\f(1,12)×d×b^3${GetEQFormat(1)}
  ${GetEQFormat(0)}= \\f(1,12)×${GRIB_H}×${GRIB_b}^3${GetEQFormat(1)}
  =${GRIB_Iy}mm^4  ${GRIB_ConstType:+
${GetEQSSubFormat('g','','2')}\: 屈曲系数 取${GRIB_g2}
${GetEQSSubFormat('g','','3')}\: 屈曲系数 取${GRIB_g3} }
J为玻璃肋抗扭惯性矩
${GetEQFormat(0)}J = db^3×(1-0.63b/d)/3${GetEQFormat(1)}
  ${GetEQFormat(0)}= ${GRIB_H}×${GRIB_b}^3×(1-0.63×${GRIB_b}/${GRIB_H})/3${GetEQFormat(1)}
  = ${GRIB_J}mm^4
G: 为玻璃的剪切模量${GetEQFormat(0)}G=\\f(E,2(1+γ))= \\f(${GetE(GRIB_GLASSNAME)},2×(1+${GetVr(GRIB_GLASSNAME)}))=${GRIB_G}${GetEQFormat(1)}
L为玻璃肋的跨度为${GRIB_Hw}m
正风压作用下${GetEQSSubFormat('y','','hp')} = ${GRIB_yhp}mm
负风压作用下${GetEQSSubFormat('y','','hn')} = ${GRIB_yhn}mm
