1).计算参数说明
${GetEQSSubFormat('β','','f')}:正面角焊缝(端焊缝)的强度设计增大系数，对承受静力荷载和间接承受动力荷载的结构取1.22；对直接承受动力荷载的结构取1.0
${GetEQSSubFormat('f','w','t')}:角焊缝的强度设计值取${GetFa(HFM)}N/mm^2  
2).焊缝剪应力计算
水平剪应力计算
${GetEQSSubFormat('A','','fx')} : 水平方向承受剪力的焊缝面积
${GetEQSSubFormat('A','','fx')} = ${GetEQSSubFormat('L','','x')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('h','','f')}×0.7
    = ${WNMV_LengthVX}×${WNMV_Hf}×0.7
    = ${WNMV_Afx}mm^2
${GetEQSSubFormat('τ','','x')}  = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('V','','x')},${GetSSubFormat('A','','fx')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${WNMV_VX}×1000,${WNMV_Afx})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${WNMV_fvx}N/mm^2
竖直剪应力计算
${GetEQSSubFormat('A','','fy')} : 竖直方向承受剪力的焊缝面积
${GetEQSSubFormat('A','','fy')} = ${GetEQSSubFormat('L','','y')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('h','','f')}×0.7
    = ${WNMV_LengthVY}×${WNMV_Hf}×0.7
    = ${WNMV_Afy}mm^2
${GetEQSSubFormat('τ','','y')}  = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('V','','y')},${GetSSubFormat('A','','fy')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${WNMV_VY}×1000,${WNMV_Afy})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${WNMV_fvy}N/mm^2
3).弯矩作用产生的正应力计算
${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','wx')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('M','','x')},${GetSSubFormat('β','','f')}×${GetSSubFormat('W','','y')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${WNMV_MX}×1000,${WNMV_belta}×${GetMin(WNMV_Wy1,WNMV_Wy2)})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${WNMV_fmx}N/mm^2
${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','wy')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('M','','y')},${GetSSubFormat('β','','f')}×${GetSSubFormat('W','','x')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${WNMV_MY}×1000,${WNMV_belta}×${GetMin(WNMV_Wz1,WNMV_Wz2)})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${WNMV_fmy}N/mm^2
4).组合应力计算
在弯矩、剪力共同作用下焊缝的组合应力验算如下：
  σ= ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r(\\b(${GetSSubFormat('σ','','wx')} + ${GetSSubFormat('σ','','wy')})${GetSSubFormat('','2','')}  + (${GetSSubFormat('τ','','x')}^2 + ${GetSSubFormat('τ','','y')}^2))${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r(\\b(${WNMV_fmx} + ${WNMV_fmy})${GetSSubFormat('','2','')} + (${WNMV_fvx}^2 + ${WNMV_fvy}^2))${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${WNMV_f}N/mm^2 ${GetLess(WNMV_Strength)}${GetEQSSubFormat('f','w','t')}=${GetFa(HFM)}N/mm^2
所以，焊缝强度${GetOKStr(WNMV_Strength)}满足要求

