　　${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','reN')}：表层混凝土因为密集配筋的剥离作用对受拉承载力的降低影响系数，按6.1.7[JGJ145-2013]采用，当锚固区钢筋间距s≥150mm或钢筋直径d≤10mm且s≥100mm时，取1.0；
    当前锚固区属于${IsEqual(CHMBOLT_AREINTYPE,0):+钢筋间距s≥150mm，取${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','reN')}=1.0}${IsEqual(CHMBOLT_AREINTYPE,1):+钢筋直径d≤10mm且s≥100mm，取${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','reN')}=1.0}${IsEqual(CHMBOLT_AREINTYPE,2):+其它类型,需要按照下式计算
　　${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','reN')}=0.5 + ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('h','','ef')},200)${GetEQFormat(1)}≤1
　　    =0.5 + ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${CHMBOLT_HEF},200)${GetEQFormat(1)}
　　    =${CHMBOLT_ψrencal}${IsLarge(CHMBOLT_ψrencal,1):+>1,取1.0}}
　　${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','ecN')}：荷载偏心${GetEQSSubFormat('e','','N')}对受拉承载力的降低影响系数，按6.1.8[JGJ145-2013]采用；
    ${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','ecN')}= ${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','ecN1')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','ecN2')} ≤1
        =${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(1, 1 + \\f(2×${GetSSubFormat('e','','Nx')},${GetSSubFormat('s','','crN')}))${GetEQFormat(1)}×${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(1, 1 + \\f(2×${GetSSubFormat('e','','Ny')},${GetSSubFormat('s','','crN')}))${GetEQFormat(1)}
        =${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(1, 1 + \\f(2×${CHMBOLT_eNx},${CHMBOLT_scrn}))${GetEQFormat(1)}×${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(1, 1 + \\f(2×${CHMBOLT_eNy},${CHMBOLT_scrn}))${GetEQFormat(1)}
        =${CHMBOLT_ψecncal}${IsLarge(CHMBOLT_ψecncal,1):+>1}
    所以，${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','ecN')}取${CHMBOLT_ψecn}。
　　把上面所得到的各项代入，得：
    ${GetEQSSubFormat('N','','Rkc')}= ${GetEQSSubFormat('N','0','Rkc')} × ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('A','','cN')},${GetSSubFormat('A','0','cN')})${GetEQFormat(1)} × ${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','sN')} × ${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','reN')} × ${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','ecN')}
　　    =${CHMBOLT_Nrkc0} × ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${CHMBOLT_Acn},${CHMBOLT_Acn0})${GetEQFormat(1)} × ${CHMBOLT_ψsn} × ${CHMBOLT_ψren} × ${CHMBOLT_ψecn} 
　　    =${CHMBOLT_Nrkc}N 
    ${GetEQSSubFormat('N','','Rdc')}=${CHMBOLT_HASEARTHQUAKE:+k×} ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('N','','Rkc')},${GetSSubFormat('γ','','RcN')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
　　    =${CHMBOLT_HASEARTHQUAKE:+${CHMBOLT_nk}×} ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${CHMBOLT_Nrkc},${CHMBOLT_γrcn})${GetEQFormat(1)}
        =${CHMBOLT_Nrdc}N   
   由于 ${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','0')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('N','g','sd')}=${Mul(CHMBOLT_Ngsd,CHMBOLT_γ0)}${GetLess(CHMBOLT_CONEPULLLESS)}${GetEQSSubFormat('N','','Rdc')},所以群锚混凝土锥体受拉破坏承载力${GetOKStr(CHMBOLT_CONEPULLLESS)}满足设计要求！

