1).计算参数说明
${GetEQSSubFormat('β','','f')}:正面角焊缝(端焊缝)的强度设计增大系数，对承受静力荷载和间接承受动力荷载的结构取${LPWELD_belta}；对直接承受动力荷载的结构取1.0
${GetEQSSubFormat('f','w','t')}:角焊缝的强度设计值取${GetFa(LPWELD_HFM)}N/mm^2  
2).焊缝剪应力计算
水平剪应力计算
${GetEQSSubFormat('A','','fx')} : 水平方向承受剪力的焊缝面积
${GetEQSSubFormat('A','','fx')} = ${GetEQSSubFormat('L','','x')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('h','','f')}×0.7
    = ${LPWELD_LengthVX}×${LPWELD_Hf}×0.7
    = ${LPWELD_Afx}mm^2
${GetEQSSubFormat('τ','','x')}  = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('V','','x')},${GetSSubFormat('A','','fx')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LPWELD_VX}×1000,${LPWELD_Afx})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${LPWELD_fvx}N/mm^2
竖直剪应力计算
${GetEQSSubFormat('A','','fy')} : 竖直方向承受剪力的焊缝面积
${GetEQSSubFormat('A','','fy')} = ${GetEQSSubFormat('L','','y')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('h','','f')}×0.7
    = ${LPWELD_LengthVY}×${LPWELD_Hf}×0.7
    = ${LPWELD_Afy}mm^2
${GetEQSSubFormat('τ','','y')}  = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('V','','y')},${GetSSubFormat('A','','fy')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LPWELD_VY}×1000,${LPWELD_Afy})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${LPWELD_fvy}N/mm^2 ${IsLarge(LPWELD_N,0):+
直接作用力产生的正应力计算
${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','n')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(N,${GetSSubFormat('β','','f')}×A)${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LPWELD_N}×10,${LPWELD_belta}×${LPWELD_Area})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${LPWELD_n}N/mm^2 } 
3).弯矩作用产生的正应力计算
${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','wy')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('M','','y')},${GetSSubFormat('β','','f')}×${GetSSubFormat('W','','y')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LPWELD_MX}×1000,${LPWELD_belta}×${GetMin(LPWELD_Wy1,LPWELD_Wy2)})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${LPWELD_fmx}N/mm^2
${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','wx')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('M','','x')},${GetSSubFormat('β','','f')}×${GetSSubFormat('W','','x')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LPWELD_MY}×1000,${LPWELD_belta}×${GetMin(LPWELD_Wz1,LPWELD_Wz2)})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${LPWELD_fmy}N/mm^2
4).组合应力计算
在弯矩、剪力、轴力共同作用下焊缝的折算应力验算如下：
  σ= ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r(\\b(${GetSSubFormat('σ','','wy')} + ${GetSSubFormat('σ','','wx')}${IsLarge(LPWELD_N,0):+ + ${GetSSubFormat('σ','','n')}})${GetSSubFormat('','2','')}  + ${GetSSubFormat('τ','','x')}^2 + ${GetSSubFormat('τ','','y')}^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r(\\b(${LPWELD_fmx} + ${LPWELD_fmy}${IsLarge(LPWELD_N,0):+ + ${LPWELD_n}})${GetSSubFormat('','2','')} + ${LPWELD_fvx}^2 + ${LPWELD_fvy}^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${LPWELD_f}N/mm^2 ${GetLess(LPWELD_Strength)}${GetEQSSubFormat('f','w','t')}=${GetFa(LPWELD_HFM)}N/mm^2
所以，焊缝强度${GetOKStr(LPWELD_Strength)}满足要求

1).水平剪应力计算
${GetEQSSubFormat('τ','','x')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('V','','x')}×${GetSSubFormat('S','','sy')},${GetSSubFormat('I','','y')}×${GetSSubFormat('t','','x')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
     = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LINKPOLE_VX}×${LINKPOLE_Sy}×100,${LINKPOLE_Iy}×${LINKPOLE_CRTY})${GetEQFormat(1)}
     = ${LINKPOLE_fvx}N/mm^2  
2).竖直剪应力计算
${GetEQSSubFormat('τ','','y')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('V','','y')}×${GetSSubFormat('S','','sx')},${GetSSubFormat('I','','x')}×t)${GetEQFormat(1)}
     = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LINKPOLE_VY}×${LINKPOLE_Sz}×100,${LINKPOLE_Iz}×${LINKPOLE_CRTZ})${GetEQFormat(1)}
     = ${LINKPOLE_fvy}N/mm^2    
