 ${GetEQSSubFormat('τ','','t')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('M','','t')},${GetSSubFormat('W','','t')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
     = ${LINKPOLE_ALLMZ}×${LINKPOLE_CJ}
     = ${LINKPOLE_fvz}N/mm^2
4)直接作用力产生的构件端部正应力计算
${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','n')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(N,A)${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LINKPOLE_N}×10,${LINKPOLE_Area})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${LINKPOLE_fn}N/mm^2 
5).弯矩作用产生的构件端部正应力计算
${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','wh')}= ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('M','','h')},γ×${GetSSubFormat('W','','y')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LINKPOLE_ALLMX}×1000,${GetMin(LINKPOLE_Wy1,LINKPOLE_Wy2)}×${GetGama(LINKPOLE_MATERIAL)})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${LINKPOLE_fmx}N/mm^2
${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','wv')}= ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('M','','v')},γ×${GetSSubFormat('W','','x')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LINKPOLE_ALLMY}×1000,${GetMin(LINKPOLE_Wz1,LINKPOLE_Wz2)}×${GetGama(LINKPOLE_MATERIAL)})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${LINKPOLE_fmy}N/mm^2   
6).组合应力计算
 在弯矩、剪力、轴力共同作用下构件的复合应力验算如下：
 σ = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r((${GetSSubFormat('σ','','wh')}+${GetSSubFormat('σ','','wv')}+${GetSSubFormat('σ','','n')})^2+(${GetSSubFormat('τ','','x')}+${GetSSubFormat('τ','','y')})^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r((${LINKPOLE_fmx}+${LINKPOLE_fmy}+${LINKPOLE_fn})^2+(${LINKPOLE_fvx}+${LINKPOLE_fvy})^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${LINKPOLE_f}N/mm^2 ${GetLess(LINKPOLE_StrengthOK)}fa=${GetFa(LINKPOLE_MATERIAL,LINKPOLE_t)}N/mm^2
 所以构件强度${GetOKStr(LINKPOLE_StrengthOK)}满足要求
7).挠度计算
 在水平剪力作用下的挠度为
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('D','','vx')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('V','','x')}×${GetSSubFormat('L','','x')}^2×(3×L-${GetSSubFormat('L','','x')}),6×E×${GetSSubFormat('I','','y')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LINKPOLE_VX}×${LINKPOLE_LengthVX}^2×(3×${LINKPOLE_Length}-${LINKPOLE_LengthVX})×10^8,6×${GetE(LINKPOLE_MATERIAL)}×${LINKPOLE_Iy})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${LINKPOLE_Dvx}mm
 竖直剪力作用下的挠度为
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('D','','vy')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('V','','y')}×${GetSSubFormat('L','','y')}^2×(3×L-${GetSSubFormat('L','','y')}),6×E×${GetSSubFormat('I','','x')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LINKPOLE_VY}×${LINKPOLE_LengthVY}^2×(3×${LINKPOLE_Length}-${LINKPOLE_LengthVY})×10^8,6×${GetE(LINKPOLE_MATERIAL)}×${LINKPOLE_Iz})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${LINKPOLE_Dvy}mm  ${LOr(IsLarge(LINKPOLE_MX,0),IsLarge(LINKPOLE_MY,0)):+
 预加弯矩产生的挠度为 ${IsLarge(LINKPOLE_MX,0):+
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('D','','mx')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('M','','xt')}×L^2,2×E×${GetSSubFormat('I','','y')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
     = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${LINKPOLE_MX}×${LINKPOLE_Length}^2×10^8,2×${GetE(LINKPOLE_MATERIAL)}×${LINKPOLE_Iy})${GetEQFormat(1)} 
     = ${LINKPOLE_Dmx}mm }${IsLarge(LINKPOLE_MY,0):+
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('D','','my')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('M','','yt')}×L^2,2×E×${GetSSubFormat('I','','x')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
