Rd = 13.5lg(m1+m2+m3+m4) + 13 + ΔR1 + ΔR2 + ΔR3
   = 13.5×lg(${GetDesity(ANTINOISE_GNAME)}/1000×(${ANTINOISE_to}+${ANTINOISE_tmg}+${ANTINOISE_ti}+${ANTINOISE_GLS4})) + 13 + ${GetMidLayerANoise(ANTINOISE_tm)} + ${GetMidLayerANoise(ANTINOISE_tml)} + ${GetMidLayerANoise(ANTINOISE_GAP4)}
