 作用在每个托块上的P = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(G,N)${GetEQFormat(1)} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${HOLDBLOCK_G},${HOLDBLOCK_N})${GetEQFormat(1)} = ${HOLDBLOCK_P}kN
 托块与主型材接触角部的截面抵抗矩为
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('W','','x')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${HOLDBLOCK_W}×${HOLDBLOCK_T}^2,6)${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${HOLDBLOCK_Wx}mm^3
 玻璃重力作用产生的弯矩为
 M = P × L
   = ${HOLDBLOCK_P}×1000×${HOLDBLOCK_L}
   = ${HOLDBLOCK_Moment}N.mm
 所以由于弯矩作用产生的正应力
 σ = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(M,${GetSSubFormat('W','','x')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${HOLDBLOCK_Moment},${HOLDBLOCK_Wx})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${HOLDBLOCK_stress}N/mm^2
 由重力作用产生的剪应力
 τ = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(P,A)${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${HOLDBLOCK_P}×1000,${HOLDBLOCK_W}×${HOLDBLOCK_T})${GetEQFormat(1)}
    = ${HOLDBLOCK_tstress}N/mm^2
 考虑复合应力
  ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r(\\b(\\f(σ,[σ]))^2 + \\b(\\f(τ,[τ]))^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
 = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r(\\b(\\f(${HOLDBLOCK_stress},${HOLDBLOCK_Fa}))^2 + \\b(\\f(${HOLDBLOCK_tstress},${HOLDBLOCK_Ft}))^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
 = ${HOLDBLOCK_strength} ${GetLess(HOLDBLOCK_STRENGTHOK)} 1 
托板强度复合强度${GetOKStr(HOLDBLOCK_STRENGTHOK)}满足要求

托板在玻璃板块重力作用下,通过铆钉连接到主型材上,在铆钉连接处会产生局部压应力作用。
铆钉数量为${GetEQSSubFormat('N','','m')}=${HOLDBLOCK_Nm}
铆钉与托板连接接触面按照下面计算考虑，单个铆钉接触面面积为
${GetEQSSubFormat('A','','m')} = ${GetEQSSubFormat('D','','m')}×t
   = ${HOLDBLOCK_Dm}×${HOLDBLOCK_T}
   = ${HOLDBLOCK_AREAfp}mm^2
${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','p')}= ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(P,${GetSSubFormat('N','','m')}×${GetSSubFormat('A','','m')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${HOLDBLOCK_P}×1000,${HOLDBLOCK_Nm}×${HOLDBLOCK_AREAfp})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${HOLDBLOCK_fpstress}N/mm^2
由于 ${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','p')}${GetLess(HOLDBLOCK_FPSTRENGTHOK)}${GetFp(HOLDBLOCK_MATERIAL,HOLDBLOCK_T)}N/mm^2,托板局部抗压强度${GetOKStr(HOLDBLOCK_FPSTRENGTHOK)}满足要求

由于重力作用,铆钉同时还承受剪力作用。
V = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(P,${GetSSubFormat('N','','m')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
  = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${HOLDBLOCK_P}×1000,${HOLDBLOCK_Nm})${GetEQFormat(1)}
  = ${HOLDBLOCK_MDshear}N      
由于 V ${GetLess(HOLDBLOCK_MDSHEAROK)}${GetFt(HOLDBLOCK_MDMATERIAL,HOLDBLOCK_Dm)}N,铆钉抗剪强度${GetOKStr(HOLDBLOCK_MDSHEAROK)}满足要求

校核依据: ${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','wp')} ≤  ${STONE_SLOTWbelta}×${GetFa(STONE_SLOTMATERIAL,STONE_SLOTTHICK)}N/mm^2
${GetEQSSubFormat('M','','p')}: 面板板块重力设计值在挂件上产生的弯矩作用
${GetEQSSubFormat('L','','p')}: 挂件水平方向悬挑长度
${GetEQSSubFormat('M','','p')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(G,n)${GetEQFormat(1)}×${GetEQSSubFormat('L','','p')}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${STONE_SLOTWG},${STONE_SLOTNUMBER})${GetEQFormat(1)}×${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${STONE_SLOTCANLEN},1000)${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${STONE_SLOTWM}kN.m
所以挂件正应力为
${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','p')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('M','','p')},${GetSSubFormat('W','','p')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${STONE_SLOTWM}×10^6,${STONE_SLOTSecW})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${STONE_SLOTWstress}N/mm^2
考虑挂件在重力作用下的剪应力,挂件承受的折算应力计算如下
${GetEQSSubFormat('σ','','wp')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r(${GetSSubFormat('σ','','p')}^2 + 3×${GetSSubFormat('τ','','wp')}^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
     = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r(${STONE_SLOTWstress}^2 + 3×${STONE_SLOTshear}^2)${GetEQFormat(1)}
     = ${STONE_SLOTWcompstress}N/mm^2
${STONE_SLOTWcompstress}N/mm^2${GetLess(STONE_FSTWSTRENGTHLESS)}${STONE_SLOTWbelta}×${GetFa(STONE_SLOTMATERIAL,STONE_SLOTTHICK)}N/mm^2  面板挂件在重力作用下的正应力${GetOKStr(STONE_FSTWSTRENGTHLESS)}满足要求

