${GetEQSSubFormat('q','','Ek')}=${GetEQSSubFormat('β','','E')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','max')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('G','','Ak')}                      (JGJ102-2003  5.3.4)
    =${βE}×${EqAMax}×${LEANGLS_GAK}
