根据6.5.6和6.4.5，单个螺母件承受的剪力如下：
V = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(1.35×${GetSSubFormat('G','','k')}×β,${STONEHCP_SHCP_n1})${GetEQFormat(1)}
${GetEQSSubFormat('G','','k')}: 面板的自重标准值,按照每一层材料的厚度以及重力密度来计算如下
${GetEQSSubFormat('G','','Ak')} = (${STONEHCP_FBMidu}×${STONEHCP_Tn}+${STONEHCP_BBMidu}×(${STONEHCP_T2}+${STONEHCP_T3})+${STONEHCP_HCMidu}×${STONEHCP_Hc})/1000
    = ${STONEHCP_GAK}kN/m^2
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('G','','k')} = ${GetEQSSubFormat('G','','Ak')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('a','','0')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('b','','0')} = ${STONEHCP_GAK}×${STONEHCP_ao}×${STONEHCP_bo}=${STONEHCP_GK}kN
β: 应力调整系数，根据承受重力的螺母数，按表6.2.2取${STONEHCP_SHCP_Belta1}
V = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(1.35×${GetSSubFormat('G','','k')}×β,${STONEHCP_SHCP_n1})${GetEQFormat(1)}
  = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(1.35×${STONEHCP_GK}×${STONEHCP_SHCP_Belta1},${STONEHCP_SHCP_n1})${GetEQFormat(1)}
  = ${STONEHCP_SHCP_V}kN 
判断依据：
V ≤ ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(0.5×P,${GetSSubFormat('g','','R')})${GetEQFormat(1)} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(0.5×${STONEHCP_SHCP_P},${STONEHCP_gr})${GetEQFormat(1)} = ${STONEHCP_SHCP_SlotVLimit}
由于V = ${STONEHCP_SHCP_V} ${GetLess(STONEHCP_SHCP_SlotVOK)} ${STONEHCP_SHCP_SlotVLimit}kN  
预置螺母连接受剪承载力${GetOKStr(STONEHCP_SHCP_SlotVOK)}满足要求

