 查表6.6.3得到η为${HPLSHEET_BSCP_NgrK}     
 D = E×t^3/(12×(1-v^2))
   = ${HPLSHEET_E}×${HPLSHEET_te}^3/(12×(1-${HPLSHEET_v}^2))
   = ${HPLSHEET_D}
df = μ×qk×b0^4/D×η
   = ${HPLSHEET_BSCP_SDr}×${HPLSHEET_WK}×${HPLSHEET_BSCP_bo}^4×10^9/${HPLSHEET_D}×${HPLSHEET_BSCP_NgrK}
   = ${HPLSHEET_BSCP_disp}mm  ${GetLess(HPLSHEET_BSCP_DLESS)}dflim=${HPLSHEET_BSCP_displimit}mm 
木纤维板的挠度${GetOKStr(HPLSHEET_BSCP_DLESS)}满足要求

校核依据：${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','f')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(μ×${GetSSubFormat('q','','k')}×${GetSSubFormat('b','','0')}^4,D)${GetEQFormat(1)}×η  ≤${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','flim')}= ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${HPLSHEET_BSCP_bo},${HPLSHEET_limit})${GetEQFormat(1)}×1000=${HPLSHEET_BSCP_displimit}mm
μ : 挠度系数，按表6.6.4取${HPLSHEET_BSCP_SDr}
 D : 面板的刚度
 E ：面板的弹性模量${HPLSHEET_E}N/mm^2
 v : 泊松比取${HPLSHEET_v}
 η: 折减系数，根据θ查表得到
 θ= ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('q','','k')}×${GetSSubFormat('b','','0')}^4,E×t^4)${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${HPLSHEET_WK}×${HPLSHEET_BSCP_bo}^4×10^9,${HPLSHEET_E}×${HPLSHEET_te}^4)${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${HPLSHEET_BSCP_thetaK}
 查表6.6.3得到η为${HPLSHEET_BSCP_NgrK}     
 D = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(E×${GetSSubFormat('t','','e')}^3,12×(1-v^2))${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${HPLSHEET_E}×${HPLSHEET_te}^3,12×(1-${HPLSHEET_v}^2))${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${HPLSHEET_D}
${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','f')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(μ×${GetSSubFormat('q','','k')}×${GetSSubFormat('b','','0')}^4,D)${GetEQFormat(1)}×η
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${HPLSHEET_BSCP_SDr}×${HPLSHEET_WK}×${HPLSHEET_BSCP_bo}^4×10^9,${HPLSHEET_D})${GetEQFormat(1)}×${HPLSHEET_BSCP_NgrK}
   = ${HPLSHEET_BSCP_disp}mm  ${GetLess(HPLSHEET_BSCP_DLESS)}dflim=${HPLSHEET_BSCP_displimit}mm 
木纤维板的挠度${GetOKStr(HPLSHEET_BSCP_DLESS)}满足要求

 单个连接点承受的拉力设计值按照下面公式计算
 N = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(q×a×b×β,n)${GetEQFormat(1)}          (JGJ 336-2016 6.6.5)
 n: 面板上共有连接点数量为${HPLSHEET_BSCP_NB}
β: 应力调整系数，根据表6.6.5取${HPLSHEET_BSCP_Belta}
 N = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(q×a×b×β,n)${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${HPLSHEET_W}×${HPLSHEET_Width}×${HPLSHEET_Height}×${HPLSHEET_BSCP_Belta},${HPLSHEET_BSCP_NB})${GetEQFormat(1)}
   = ${HPLSHEET_BSCP_N}kN
 单个连接点连接的受拉承载力设计值应满足下面条件
 N ≤ ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(P,${GetSSubFormat('g','','R')})${GetEQFormat(1)}
 P : 实测所得背面支承连接点连接受拉破坏力最小值
 ${GetEQSSubFormat('g','','R')}: 背面支承连接点连接承载力分项系数，取2.15
 ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(P,${GetSSubFormat('g','','R')})${GetEQFormat(1)} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${HPLSHEET_BSCP_P},${HPLSHEET_BSCP_gr})${GetEQFormat(1)} = ${HPLSHEET_BSCP_SlotNLimit}kN
 由于 N ${GetLess(HPLSHEET_BSCP_SlotNOK)} ${HPLSHEET_BSCP_SlotNLimit}kN
 背面支承连接点承受的拉力设计值${GetOKStr(HPLSHEET_BSCP_SlotNOK)}满足要求

 槽式埋件的混凝土锥体抗剪承载力设计值按照下面公式计算
   ${GetEQSSubFormat('V','','Rd,c,a')} = ${GetEQSSubFormat('V','0','Rd,c,a')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','s,V,a')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','c,V,a')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','h,V,a')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','90,V,a')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','ucr,V,a')}    
   上面计算公式中
  ${GetEQSSubFormat('V','0','Rd,c,a')} : 单一锚筋的混凝土基本抗剪承载力设计值
  ${GetEQSSubFormat('V','0','Rd,c,a')} = 2.7×${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r(${GetSSubFormat('f','','cu,k')})${GetEQFormat(1)}×${GetEQSSubFormat('c','','1')}^1.5 = 2.7×${GetEQFormat(0)}\\r(${TROEMB_fcuk})${GetEQFormat(1)}×${TROEMB_C1}^1.5 = ${TROEMB_Vrdca0}N
  ${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','s,V,a')} : 相邻锚筋间的影响系数
  ${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','h,V,a')} : 混凝土基材厚度影响系数
  ${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','c,V,a')} : 混凝土基材边角影响系数
     ${GetEQSSubFormat('h','','a')} : 混凝土基材厚度${TROEMB_Ha}mm
  ${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','90,V,a')}: 剪力与垂直于构件自由边轴线间的夹角对受剪承载力的影响系数，当前为${TROEMB_ForceVParaSide:+剪力与混凝土基材自由边平行且垂直于埋件方向}${TROEMB_ForceVParaSide:*其它情况}，取${TROEMB_alphava}
  ${GetEQSSubFormat('s','','cr,V,a')}: 锚筋的临界间距，按照${GetEQSSubFormat('s','','cr,V,a')} = 4×${GetEQSSubFormat('c','','1')}+2×${GetEQSSubFormat('b','','ch')} = 4×${TROEMB_C1} + 2×${TROEMB_Bch} = ${TROEMB_Scrva}mm
  ${GetEQSSubFormat('c','','cr,V,a')}: 锚筋的临界边离，按照${GetEQSSubFormat('c','','cr,V,a')} = 0.5×${GetEQSSubFormat('s','','cr,V,a')} = ${TROEMB_Ccrva}mm取值   
${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','ucr,V,a')}: 混凝土裂缝对锚固区预埋件承载力的影响系数，当前为${IsEqual(TROEMB_CrackFactor,0):+混凝土边缘无钢筋或箍筋，}${IsEqual(TROEMB_CrackFactor,1):+混凝土边缘有钢筋且直径≥12mm，}${IsEqual(TROEMB_CrackFactor,2):+混凝土边缘有钢筋和箍筋，且间距小于100mm，}${IsEqual(TROEMB_CrackFactor,3):+非裂缝混凝土，}取${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','ucr,V,a')}=${TROEMB_rucrva}  
  下面对上面需要的各参数进行计算
    ${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','c,V,a')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\b(\\f(${GetSSubFormat('c','','2')},${GetSSubFormat('c','','cr,V,a')}))^0.5${GetEQFormat(1)} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\b(\\f(${TROEMB_C2},${TROEMB_Ccrva}))^0.5${GetEQFormat(1)} = ${TROEMB_acvacal} ${IsLarge(TROEMB_acvacal,1):+取${TROEMB_acva}}
    ${GetEQSSubFormat('h','','cr,V,a')} = 2×${GetEQSSubFormat('c','','1')} + 2×${GetEQSSubFormat('h','','ch')} = 2×${TROEMB_C1} + 2×${TROEMB_Hch} = ${TROEMB_Hcrva}mm
    ${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','h,V,a')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\b(\\f(${GetSSubFormat('h','','a')},${GetSSubFormat('h','','cr,V,a')}))^0.5${GetEQFormat(1)} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\b(\\f(${TROEMB_Ha},${TROEMB_Hcrva}))^0.5${GetEQFormat(1)} = ${TROEMB_ahvacal} ${IsLarge(TROEMB_ahvacal,1):+取${TROEMB_ahva}}
    ${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','s,V,a')} = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(1,1+∑\\b(\\b(1 - \\f(${GetSSubFormat('s','','i')},${GetSSubFormat('s','','cr,V,a')}))^1.5 × \\f(${GetSSubFormat('V','','i')},${GetSSubFormat('V','','0')})))${GetEQFormat(1)} = ${TROEMB_asva}   ,说明：该求和计算是将第${TROEMB_AvstInd}个锚筋作为当前锚筋，其他按照临界距离范围内的锚筋来参与求和计算的，${GetEQSSubFormat('s','','i')}是临界距离内的其它锚筋到当前锚筋的距离。
  ${GetEQSSubFormat('V','','Rd,c,a')} = ${GetEQSSubFormat('V','0','Rd,c,a')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','s,V,a')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','c,V,a')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','h,V,a')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','90,V,a')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','ucr,V,a')} 
        = ${TROEMB_Vrdca0}×${TROEMB_asva}×${TROEMB_acva}×${TROEMB_ahva}×${TROEMB_alphava}×${TROEMB_rucrva}     
        = ${TROEMB_Vrdca}N
  由于${GetEQSSubFormat('V','','j')}=${TROEMB_Vmj}N ${GetLess(TROEMB_ConcreteShearLESS)} ${GetEQSSubFormat('V','','Rd,c,a')} = ${TROEMB_Vrdca}N，故混凝土锥体抗剪承载力${GetOKStr(TROEMB_ConcreteShearLESS)}满足设计要求

