αmax: 水平地震影响系数最大值:${EqAMax}
qEk: 分布水平地震作用标准值(kN/m^2)
qEk=βE×αmax×GAK                     
   =${βE}×${EqAMax}×${MSGPGLS_GAK}
   =${MSGPGLS_HEQK}kN/m^2
rE: 地震作用分项系数: ${γEf}
qEA: 分布水平地震作用设计值(kN/m^2)
qEA=rE×qEk
   =${γEf}×${MSGPGLS_HEQK}
   =${Mul(γEf,MSGPGLS_HEQK)}kN/m^2
对于倾斜幕墙，不考虑雪荷载、活荷载等组合，仅考虑重力、垂直于面板的风荷载以及水平方向作用的地震荷载。具体组合如下：
荷载设计值组合：γg×重力荷载+γw×风荷载±ψE×γE×水平地震荷载
荷载标准值组合: 重力荷载+风荷载标准值
实际组合的时候还需要考虑面板的角度以及风荷载的作用方向问题。
θ:面板与水平面的夹角${MSGPGLS_Angle}度
正风压作用下垂直于面板的荷载组合如下：
Spe+ = GAK×γg×cos(θ) + Wkp×γw + ψE×γE×qEk×sin(θ)
     = ${MSGPGLS_GAK}×${MSGPGLS_GRatioP}×cos(${MSGPGLS_Angle}) + ${MSGPGLS_WKP}×${γwf} + ${ψE}×${γEf}×${MSGPGLS_HEQK}×sin(${MSGPGLS_Angle})
     = ${MSGPGLS_COMPPEA}
Spe- = GAK×γg×cos(θ) + Wkp×γw - ψE×γE×qEk×sin(θ)
     = ${MSGPGLS_COMPPES}
Spk  = GAK×cos(θ) + Wkp
     = ${MSGPGLS_COMPKP}
负风压作用下垂直于面板的荷载组合如下：
Sne+ = GAK×γg×cos(θ) + Wkn×γw + ψE×γE×qEk×sin(θ)
     = ${MSGPGLS_GAK}×${MSGPGLS_GRatioN}×cos(${MSGPGLS_Angle}) + (${MSGPGLS_WKN})×${γwf} + ${ψE}×${γEf}×${MSGPGLS_HEQK}×sin(${MSGPGLS_Angle})
     = ${MSGPGLS_COMPNEA}
Sne- = GAK×γg×cos(θ) + Wkn×γw - ψE×γE×qEk×sin(θ)
     = ${MSGPGLS_COMPNES}
Snk  = GAK×cos(θ) + Wkn
     = ${MSGPGLS_COMPKN}
综合上面的计算信息，对于玻璃面板，垂直于面板的荷载组合设计值为${MSGPGLS_COMP}kN/m^2，荷载组合标准值为${MSGPGLS_COMPK}kN/m^2。

${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','max')}: 水平地震影响系数最大值:${EqAMax}
${GetEQSSubFormat('q','','Ek')}: 分布水平地震作用标准值(kN/m^2)
${GetEQSSubFormat('q','','Ek')}=${GetEQSSubFormat('β','','E')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('α','','max')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('G','','Ak')}                      (JGJ102-2003  5.3.4)
    =${βE}×${EqAMax}×${MSGPGLS_GAK}
    =${MSGPGLS_HEQK}kN/m^2
${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','E')}: 地震作用分项系数: ${γEf}
${GetEQSSubFormat('q','','EA')}: 分布水平地震作用设计值(kN/m^2)
${GetEQSSubFormat('q','','EA')}=${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','E')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('q','','Ek')}
   =${γEf}×${MSGPGLS_HEQK}
   =${Mul(γEf,MSGPGLS_HEQK)}kN/m^2
对于倾斜幕墙，不考虑雪荷载、活荷载等组合，仅考虑重力、垂直于面板的风荷载以及水平方向作用的地震荷载。具体组合如下：
荷载设计值组合：${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','G')}×重力荷载+${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','w')}×风荷载±${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','E')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','E')}×水平地震荷载
荷载标准值组合: 重力荷载+风荷载标准值
实际组合的时候还需要考虑面板的角度以及风荷载的作用方向问题。
θ:面板与水平面的夹角${MSGPGLS_Angle}度
正风压作用下垂直于面板的荷载组合如下：
${GetEQSSubFormat('S','','pe1')} = ${GetEQSSubFormat('G','','Ak')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','G')}×cos(θ) + ${GetEQSSubFormat('W','','kp')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','w')} + ${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','E')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','E')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('q','','EA')}×sin(θ)
     = ${MSGPGLS_GAK}×${MSGPGLS_GRatioP}×cos(${MSGPGLS_Angle}) + ${MSGPGLS_WKP}×${γwf} + ${ψE}×${γEf}×${MSGPGLS_HEQK}×sin(${MSGPGLS_Angle})
     = ${MSGPGLS_COMPPEA}
${GetEQSSubFormat('S','','pe2')} = ${GetEQSSubFormat('G','','Ak')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','G')}×cos(θ) + ${GetEQSSubFormat('W','','kp')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','w')} - ${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','E')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','E')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('q','','EA')}×sin(θ)
     = ${MSGPGLS_COMPPES}
${GetEQSSubFormat('S','','pk')}  = ${GetEQSSubFormat('G','','Ak')}×cos(θ) + ${GetEQSSubFormat('W','','kp')}
     = ${MSGPGLS_COMPKP}
负风压作用下垂直于面板的荷载组合如下：
${GetEQSSubFormat('S','','ne1')} = ${GetEQSSubFormat('G','','Ak')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','G')}×cos(θ) + ${GetEQSSubFormat('W','','kn')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','w')} + ${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','E')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','E')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('q','','EA')}×sin(θ)
     = ${MSGPGLS_GAK}×${MSGPGLS_GRatioN}×cos(${MSGPGLS_Angle}) + (${MSGPGLS_WKN})×${γwf} + ${ψE}×${γEf}×${MSGPGLS_HEQK}×sin(${MSGPGLS_Angle})
     = ${MSGPGLS_COMPNEA}
${GetEQSSubFormat('S','','ne2')} = ${GetEQSSubFormat('G','','Ak')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','G')}×cos(θ) +${GetEQSSubFormat('W','','kn')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','w')} - ${GetEQSSubFormat('ψ','','E')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('γ','','E')}×${GetEQSSubFormat('q','','EA')}×sin(θ)
     = ${MSGPGLS_COMPNES}
${GetEQSSubFormat('S','','nk')}  = ${GetEQSSubFormat('G','','Ak')}×cos(θ) + ${GetEQSSubFormat('W','','kn')}
     = ${MSGPGLS_COMPKN}
综合上面的计算信息，对于玻璃面板，垂直于面板的荷载组合设计值为${MSGPGLS_COMP}kN/m^2，荷载组合标准值为${MSGPGLS_COMPK}kN/m^2。

校核依据: ${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','f')}≤${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','flim')}=${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${MSGPGLS_awl},60)${GetEQFormat(1)}×1000=${MSGPGLS_dflim}mm                
D: 玻璃刚度(N·mm)
ν: 玻璃泊松比: ${GetVr(MSGPGLS_NAME)}
E: 玻璃弹性模量 : ${GetE(GLOB_BOARDMATERIAL)}N/mm^2   
D = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(E×${GetSSubFormat('h','3','ef,w')},12×(1-ν^2))${GetEQFormat(1)}
  = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetE(GLOB_BOARDMATERIAL)}×${MSGPGLS_Efdisp}^3,12×(1-${νw}^2))${GetEQFormat(1)}
  = ${MSGPGLS_Dw}N·mm
${GetEQSSubFormat('q','','k')}: 玻璃所受组合荷载标准值:${MSGPGLS_COMPK}kN/m^2
μ: 挠度系数,按边长比a/b查     表6.1.3得: ${GetSDr(MSGPGLS_Hw,MSGPGLS_Bw)}
参数θ计算: 
θ= ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSSubFormat('q','','k')}×a^4,E×${GetSSubFormat('h','4','ef,w')})${GetEQFormat(1)}        
  = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${MSGPGLS_COMPK}×${MSGPGLS_awl}^4,${GetE(GLOB_BOARDMATERIAL)}×${MSGPGLS_Efdisp}^4)${GetEQFormat(1)}×10^9 
  = ${MSGPGLS_θwe} 
η: 折减系数,根据参数θ查表6.1.2-2  得η = ${GetNg(MSGPGLS_θwe)} 
${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','f')}: 玻璃组合荷载标准值作用下挠度最大值
${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','f')}=${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(μ×${GetSSubFormat('q','','k')}×a^4,D)${GetEQFormat(1)}×η         (JGJ102-2003  6.1.3-2)
  =${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetSDr(MSGPGLS_Hw,MSGPGLS_Bw)}×${MSGPGLS_COMPK}×${MSGPGLS_awl}^4,${MSGPGLS_Dw})${GetEQFormat(1)}×${GetNg(MSGPGLS_θwe)}×10^9 
  =${MSGPGLS_dfw}mm 
${MSGPGLS_DISP}mm${GetLess(MSGPGLS_DLESS)}${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','flim')}=${MSGPGLS_dflim}mm 
玻璃的挠度${MSGPGLS_DLESS:*不}满足

校核依据: ${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','f')}≤${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','flim')}=${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${MSGPGLS_PS_bl},60)${GetEQFormat(1)}×1000=${MSGPGLS_PS_dflim}mm            
D: 玻璃刚度(N·mm)
ν: 玻璃泊松比: ${GetVr(MSGPGLS_NAME)}
E: 玻璃弹性模量 : ${GetE(MSGPGLS_NAME)}N/mm^2   
${GetEQFormat(0)}D = \\f(E × ${GetSSubFormat('h','3','ef,w')},12×(1-ν^2))${GetEQFormat(1)}
  = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${GetE(MSGPGLS_NAME)}×${MSGPGLS_PS_Efdisp}^3,12×(1-${νw}^2))${GetEQFormat(1)}
  = ${MSGPGLS_PS_Dw}N·mm
${GetEQSSubFormat('q','','k')}: 玻璃所受组合荷载标准值:${MSGPGLS_COMPK}kN/m^2
μ: 挠度系数,按边长比a/b查     表8.1.5-2得: ${MSGPGLS_PS_SDr}
参数θ计算: 
${GetEQFormat(0)}θ= \\f(${GetSSubFormat('q','','k')}×a^4,E × ${GetSSubFormat('h','4','ef,w')})${GetEQFormat(1)}       
  = ${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${MSGPGLS_COMPK}×${MSGPGLS_PS_bl}^4,${GetE(MSGPGLS_NAME)}×${MSGPGLS_PS_Efdisp}^4)×10^9${GetEQFormat(1)} 
  = ${MSGPGLS_PS_θwe} 
η: 折减系数,根据参数θ查表6.1.2-2  得η = ${MSGPGLS_PS_Nge} 
${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','f')}: 玻璃组合荷载标准值作用下挠度最大值
${GetEQFormat(0)}${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','f')}=\\f(μ×${GetSSubFormat('q','','k')}×b^4,D)×η${GetEQFormat(1)}         (JGJ102-2003  6.1.3-2)
  =${GetEQFormat(0)}\\f(${MSGPGLS_PS_SDr}×${MSGPGLS_COMPK}×${MSGPGLS_PS_bl}^4,${MSGPGLS_PS_Dw})×${MSGPGLS_PS_Nge}×10^9${GetEQFormat(1)} 
  =${MSGPGLS_PS_dfw}mm 
${MSGPGLS_PS_DISP}mm${GetLess(MSGPGLS_PS_DLESS)}${GetEQSSubFormat('d','','flim')}=${MSGPGLS_PS_dflim}mm 
玻璃的挠度${MSGPGLS_PS_DLESS:*不}满足
